      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: If you go into Root's Alpha world, you can recreate the issue doing what I've been doing EVERY time for the past few weeks.  Select \"TVShows\" > \"Comedy\" > \"The Office\".  I'm currently at Season 3, but you can select any episode.  It starts off ok, but in about 3-10 minutes it's off.  I have to pause the stream, reset the progress bar to a time a few seconds before where I paused, and then press play to re-sync.  Give it another few minutes and repeat.  If you just pause and play, it solves nothing.  Hope this helps.  I though this was just a content issue and never reported it to Root.  My bad.  :(",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
